  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "id": 13855,
      "0": "Deeply etched runes along the hem shimmer with a faint, inner light. This garment flows around the body like a protective veil, shielding the spirit from the weight of the world. It grants a lightness of limb to the one who dons it, as if the very air supports their stride."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Coarse wool and faded silk layers overlap, mended with thick stitching at the hem. The fabric holds the stiff scent of old incense and dry dust, moving with a muted rustle against the skin."
    }
  },
